Exterior Features - Terrace/Deck; High Floor; Low Floor; 

Interior Features - Attic; Entrance hall; Wardrobes; 

Facing - South; Southeast; Southwest; 

Other Equipment - Internet service; Piped gas; 

Views - City view; River view; 

Other features - Balcony; Equipped kitchen; Storage room; Townhouse; House; 

